{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting the Client"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Time-Out "}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le09ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Closing a Business Deal"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In a business negotiation, it is important to know when and how to complete a transaction or negotiation. You need to make sure the other party understands your terms and any other actions that need to be taken.<br/><br/>Here is some language you can use to ensure you can close a deal."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li>Talking about things you agreed on. <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We've <span class=\"underline\">settled on</span> more than what we expected. <br/>We've <span class=\"underline\">agreed to</span> purchasing a new tracking system. <br/>As we <span class=\"underline\">agreed</span>, we'll be taking care of the training. </span> </li><br/><li>Talking about things that need to be decided <span class=\"italic\"><br/>He <span class=\"underline\">seems</span> pretty eager to get the partnership going. <br/>He <span class=\"underline\">seems</span> ready to close the deal. <br/><span class=\"underline\">Wouldn't now be the time to</span> mention our current staff member working in South America? <br/>I am ready to <span class=\"underline\">sign off on</span> the agreement. <br/>Sure. Go ahead and <span class=\"underline\">sign to</span> what we've decided. </span> </li><br/><li>Talking about things that need to be arranged (future \tmeeting) <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We'll be arranging a meeting for that. <br/>We need to arrange a follow-up meeting to discuss that. </span> </li><br/><li>Emphasizing the benefits <span class=\"italic\"><br/>We want to ensure that you feel this is the right choice for your company. <br/>All in all, you've got yourself a great deal. </span> </li></ol>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future with Present Continuous and Will"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many different ways in which you can express the future in English. Here's how to use the Present Continuous and \u201cwill\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Use the Present Continuous to talk about future plans. <span class=\"italic\"><br/><br/>We are arranging a meeting in the future<br/>We are settling on a final price.<br/>We are agreeing to system that will help us track our inventory.</span></li><br/><li>Use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about a voluntary action. We normally do this when we respond to someone's offers or offer to do something for someone else.<span class=\"italic\"><br/><br/>You'll need to send me a copy of that document. <br/>We will need to make arrangements.<br/>This will help her to know that we are likely to be successful.</span></li></ul>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "private office"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an office that only one person or group may use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm calling you from a private office."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you may hear when closing a deal."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come straight out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tell something directly without hiding one's plans, feelings or important facts"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: However, he's not coming straight out regarding his training needs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "impending"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an event or situation (usually unpleasant) that will soon happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He mentioned some impending discussion with his personnel team."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dual"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having two similar aspects or functions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Won't now be the time to mention Ferdinand's role with the dual staging of the main PR events in North and South America?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ahead of the game"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being early; having done more research than competitors so far"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will help him to know that we're already ahead of the game."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the following clues and act out a dialogue."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Student A</span><br/> You are about to close a negotiation to deliver training for a company. Your co-worker wants to talk to you before you seal the deal. He has questions and doubts. Make sure you clarify and explain the deal focusing on:<br/> <ul> <li>things you agreed on</li> <li>things that need to be discussed and arranged</li> </ul>Finally, emphasize the benefits of the transaction.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Student B</span><br/> Your co-worker is about to close a very important negotiation to deliver training for a big multinational company. You have many questions you want to ask them before they close the deal.<br/> Brainstorm a list of questions and be prepared to ask them.<br/> Finally, give your co-worker permission to close the deal.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I clarify and explain the agreements of a deal."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I clarify details which still need to be arranged."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I emphasize on a deal's benefits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask to clarify details before closing a deal."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can plan steps necessary for future action."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can negotiate a deal."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When do you know a negotiation is over?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How do you emphasize the benefits of the deal?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "How will we continue negotiations?"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "STI", 